^^ Loop counters are read-only integers that exist only inside their loop.
gene nucleus()
    "ACGT" -> dna g
    cycle i across g
        "A" -> i                ^^ counters are read-only
        when i = i              ^^ counters are not sequences
            report g
        stop
        when i                  ^^ nor conditions
            report g
        stop
        report head(i)
    stop
    report g@i                  ^^ i does not exist after its loop
stop
